flowchart TD
  lease{Take the compaction lease}:::check
  lease -->|busy| busy(Another compaction holds the lease):::transform
  lease -->|ok| expire{Judge consumers pinning old or over-budget days}:::check
  expire -->|none| kept(No consumer expires):::transform
  expire -->|report| reported(Would expire: recorded only, report mode):::transform
  expire -->|expired| expired(Expired: mirror needs a resync, pin released):::transform
  expire --> day[Drop a sealed day below every pin]:::load
  day --> stop{Why the run stopped}:::check
  stop -->|done| done(Every day is dropped):::transform
  stop -->|pinned| pinned(A pin still needs the next day):::transform
  stop -->|not_sealed| open(The next day is not sealed yet):::transform
  stop -->|no_pins| nopins(No pins yet: nothing may drop):::transform
  stop -->|held| held(A published table lost its pin):::transform
  stop -->|capped| capped(Runtime cap; the next run continues):::transform
  stop -->|busy| conflict(The lease or a concurrent change stopped a day):::transform
  stop -->|invariant| invariant(Refused: the floor would pass the ingest checkpoint):::transform
  class day fanout
